1
00:00:10,152 --> 00:00:15,075
What was said, and when. The part
that usually lives in somebody's head.

2
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:22,605
A line after a phone call is enough. It
is not a report; it is a reminder for

3
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:24,075
whoever is next.

4
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:30,242
Where the client stands is a state you
can see, not something to be recalled.

5
00:00:30,696 --> 00:00:35,586
Move it when something changes, and
everybody reading the book is reading the same

6
00:00:35,586 --> 00:00:35,944
thing.

7
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:42,250
Underneath it, every job and every
invoice you have ever raised for them.

8
00:00:42,703 --> 00:00:47,208
Next: raising a job for a
client, at their own address.

